  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This Greek salad serves 4 and takes around 10 minutes to put together with no cooking at all. Ripe tomatoes, courgette, olives and a thick slab of feta are dressed with olive oil and oregano for one of the most straightforward dishes in Greek cooking."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The quality of the ingredients matters here more than in any cooked dish. Use the ripest tomatoes you can find and a good-quality block of feta rather than pre-crumbled. The dressing is nothing more than olive oil and a little salt, so there is nowhere for poor ingredients to hide."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "ingredientsList",
        "attrs": {
          "defaultServings": 4,
          "items": [
